    <string name="how_title">How it works</string>
    <string name="how_1_title">1. Install the app on 2 phones.</string>
    <string name="how_1_body">One stays in the car (with internet, WiFi or 4G, and GPS on), the other is yours.</string>
    <string name="how_2_title">2. The car phone.</string>
    <string name="how_2_body">Choose “In the car”, enter your secret code, set the sensitivity and activate the protection.</string>
    <string name="how_3_title">3. Your phone.</string>
    <string name="how_3_body">Choose “My phone”, enter the same code and start listening. If the car moves, you get an alarm with its GPS position.</string>
